  bugs:
  - title: '<Bug> [Crouch]'
    description: When uncrouching under a roof clipping occurs.
  - title: '<Bug> [Unicode] '
    description: 'Having a steam name that uses non english characters can

      break
      the chat, and crash the game.'
  - title: '<Bug> [Settings] '
    description: Resolution Change can make the game Dark.
  - title: '<Bug> [Networking]'
    description: 'After a full session and after win room, when players return to
      Lobby, their state says: In-Elevator.'
  - title: '<Bug> [Text Chat]'
    description: ' White space message keeps the chat open '
  - title: '<Bug> [Networking] '
    description: Player's names in top right corner don't reset for reconnected client
  - title: '<Bug> [Collisions]'
    description: ' Table Colliders issue & items going through them'
  - title: '<Bug> [Collisions] '
    description: You should NOT be able to climb on items?
  - title: '<Bug> [Collisions] '
    description: Players should not be able to climb on each other
  - title: '<Bug> [Elevator] '
    description: When you spam interact the elevator button, the door animation resets
  - title: '<Bug> [Collisions]'
    description: ' Main Room Shelf Climbing should NOT happen'
  - title: '<Bug> [Networking] '
    description: PasswordProtectedLobbies - Pressing Join after a wrong password
      will still play join animation
  - title: '<Bug> [Tool - Level Editor]'
    description: ' SnapshotID GUIDs reset when viewing prefab in isolation'
